WEBVTT

00:00:10.617 --> 00:00:11.630
<v><b>Laura:</b></v> Hello, everybody.

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:12.920
Welcome to the class.

00:00:13.216 --> 00:00:14.124
I’m Laura.

00:00:14.311 --> 00:00:15.151
I’m your teacher.

00:00:17.304 --> 00:00:18.344
OK, let’s go.

00:00:18.712 --> 00:00:19.552
Look at me.

00:00:38.657 --> 00:00:40.715
<v><b>Dan:</b></v> Hi, I’m Dan.

00:00:41.354 --> 00:00:41.961
What’s your name?

00:00:43.367 --> 00:00:44.174
<v><b>Jasmine:</b></v> Jasmine.

00:00:45.068 --> 00:00:45.835
<v><b>Dan:</b></v> Sorry?

00:00:46.295 --> 00:00:47.080
<v><b>Jasmine:</b></v> Jasmine!

00:00:57.442 --> 00:00:58.135
<v><b>Dan:</b></v> Hey.

00:00:58.495 --> 00:00:59.480
What’s your phone number?

00:01:00.241 --> 00:01:13.448
<v><b>Jasmine:</b></v> It’s 936-555-0271.

00:01:14.334 --> 00:01:23.703
<v><b>Dan:</b></v> 936-555-0271.

00:01:24.103 --> 00:01:25.947
<v><b>Jasmine:</b></v> Yes. Text me.

00:01:29.899 --> 00:01:30.506
Thanks.

00:01:39.010 --> 00:01:39.720
<v><b>Ed:</b></v> Hi, Dan.

00:01:41.105 --> 00:01:41.952
<v><b>Dan:</b></v> Hello.

00:01:43.098 --> 00:01:44.706
This is Jasmine.

00:01:45.319 --> 00:01:46.999
She’s in my salsa class.

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:48.920
<v><b>Ed:</b></v> Nice to meet you.

00:01:49.449 --> 00:01:50.282
My name’s Ed.

00:01:51.057 --> 00:01:52.397
<v><b>Jasmine:</b></v> Nice to meet you, too.

00:01:56.229 --> 00:01:57.909
<v><b>Dan:</b></v> Bye, Jasmine.

00:01:58.800 --> 00:01:59.686
<v><b>Jasmine:</b></v> Goodbye, Dan.

00:02:01.607 --> 00:02:03.033
Bye, Ed.

00:02:12.387 --> 00:02:13.320
<v><b>Ed:</b></v> Hi, Jasmine.

00:02:15.161 --> 00:02:15.840
<v><b>Jasmine:</b></v> Ed!

00:02:17.041 --> 00:02:19.333
Are you in the salsa class, too?

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:20.620
<v><b>Ed:</b></v> Yes, I am.

00:02:20.906 --> 00:02:21.640
How are you?

00:02:22.177 --> 00:02:24.621
<v><b>Jasmine:</b></v> I’m good, thank you.

00:02:25.607 --> 00:02:26.493
And you?

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:28.080
<v><b>Ed:</b></v> Fine, thanks.

00:02:31.188 --> 00:02:33.080
<v><b>Laura:</b></v> OK, everybody, with your partners.

00:02:33.227 --> 00:02:34.854
Ed, you’re with Jasmine.

00:02:35.486 --> 00:02:37.225
<v><b>Ed:</b></v> Great! You’re my partner!

00:02:37.365 --> 00:02:38.205
<v><b>Jasmine:</b></v> Yes!

00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:42.527
See you later, Dan.